hṛtpadme nābhipadme ca mukhapadme tathaiva ca || 5 ||

vasate paramātmā vai yadi śaknoṣi veditum |
navadvārāṇi saṅghaṭṭa navanāḍīrnirodhayet || 6 ||

saṃhṛtya navavāyūṃśca hṛtpadme tān praveśayet |
tasya padmasya vai nālaṃ piṅgalānāḍirucyate || 7 ||

tayā proktāstrayaḥ paścāt sūtre maṇigaṇā iva |
pradhānānāḍayastrisrastālabdhvā vedayet puram || 8 ||

tāsāṃ mukhyā tu vai hyekā tāṃ jñātvā jñāyaṃse param |
tasyā madhye sthitaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvakāraṇamavyayam || 9 ||

yaṃ viditvā mahāsena uktāntriṃ kartu marhasi |
daśamadvāramāśritya daśamānāḍikā (*)(?) ha || 10 ||

daśamaṃ pavanaṃ labdhvā viṣuvat grahaṇaṃ bhavet |
ākāśaṃ grāhayet tasya granthi bhedaiḥ śanaiḥ śanaiḥ || 11 ||

<p. 2> kṛtvā vai brahmasandhānaṃ samyag jñātvā parāṃ gatim |
pare sthāne layaṃ kṛtvā niṣkampaḥ susamāhitaḥ || 12 ||

praṇave saṃharedātmā grāhyaṃ niśśeṣamārutam |
praṇavaṃ tu samuccārya tālvoṣṭhapuṭaśobhitam || 13 ||

kalpāyurapi tatraivamākramatyanu saṃśayaḥ |
karaṇānyapraśeṣāṇi granthi dvārāṇi sarvaśaḥ || 14 ||

nāḍayaḥ pavanāt sarvā viditvā sarvamucyate |
yāvacca jñāyate vatsa tāvad brahmalayī bhavet || 15 ||

taṃ viditvā mahāsena utkrānti kartu marhasi || 16 ||

kasmin sthāne sthito brahmā kena dvāreṇa siddhyati |
etat sarvaṃ samācakṣva yadi tuṣṭosi me prabho || 17 ||

<p. 2b> brahmā brahme laye kuryād bhūtād bhūteṣu valayam |
anyathā naiva siddhyanti kalpakoṭi śatairapi || 18 ||

bhūtāṃstyaktvā tu vai deva kena dvāreṇa siddhyati |
etan me saṃśayaṃ sarvaṃ vaktumarhasya śeṣataḥ || 19 ||

guhyāti guhyaṃ guhyaṃ ca atiguhyaṃ ṣaḍānana |
yattvayā veditaṃ praśnaṃ tat sarvaṃ kathayāmite || 20 ||

vyoma madhye sthitā sūryaḥ sūryamadhye sthitaḥ saśī |
śaśi madhye sthitaṃ tejastejomadhye sthitaṃ param || 21 ||

ṛju snigdhaṃ ca vimalaṃ vidyullekhe vadussaham |
(**)(?) koṭi(?) pratīkāśaṃ duṣprekṣaṃ layavarjitam || 22 ||

hṛtpa (****************) (?) sūryaṃ śaśi hṛtāsanam |
teṣāṃ madhye paraṃ tejo ye nedaṃ pratitiṣṭhitam || 23 ||

<p. 3a> mahattejāṃsi yaccittaṃ pratyakṣaṃ yasya ṣaṇmukha |
brahmadvārasya vai pṛṣṭhe dhūmroyaṃ sarvataḥ sthitaḥ || 24 ||

hṛdisthaṃ gaganasthaṃ ca ubhāvekatra cintayet |
anyathā naiva siddhyanti yuktihīnāḥ śikhidhvaja || 25 ||

yanmayoktaṃ paraṃbrahma hṛdyākāśe vyavasthitam |
sā śaktiḥ sa śivaṃ jñānaṃ jñeyaṃ cākṣaramavyayam || 26 ||

etat te brahmasandhānaṃ brahmadvāreṇa yo bhavet |
sa muktaḥ sarvaduḥkhebhyaḥ sadyo brahmaṇi kalpayan || 27 ||

utkrānti kāle tasyedaṃ viditaṃ brahmaṇo layam |
sa vai līno pare vatsa ityājñā pārameśvarī || 28 ||

brahmanāḍiṃ brahmavāyuṃ brahma (****)(?) labhet |
brahmaṇaṃ tu samantavyaṃ brahmākṣara la (***)(?) || 29 ||

<p. 3b> praṇavaṃ hṛtsthitaṃ padmaṃ praṇavaṃ vyomni saṃsti (*)(?) m |
kālāgni rudraparyantaṃ yāvadbrahmāṇḍagocaram || 30 ||

sarvaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ pareṇedaṃ praṇaveṇa śikhidhvaja |
vāṅmayaṃ sakalaṃ yaśca trailokyaṃ sa carācaram || 31 ||

brahmādi stambha paryantaṃ sarvaṃ praṇavasambhavam |
tasmin neva layaṃ kuryāt te caiva brahmavādinaḥ || 32 ||

sa eva paramaṃ sthānaṃ sa eva paramākṣaram |
tryakṣaraṃ ca tridhā bhinnaṃ tristhānaṃ triguṇātmakam || 33 ||

tridevāgni trayaṃ caiva tridevaṃ paramaṃ smṛtam |
pañcamūrti dharaṃ devaṃ śivaṃ paramakāraṇam || 34 ||

(***) dyantare vatsa yadi saknoṣi veditum |
devadānava (*) (?) ddhānāṃ gandharvoragarakṣasām || 35 ||

sarveṣāṃ praṇavaṃ yoni layaṃ tatraiva ṣa (**)(?) |
<p. 4a> brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraḥ śiva eva ca || 36 ||

praṇaveṇa tu vai siddhāḥ sambhūtāḥ praṇavena tu |
akṣaraṃ cakṣaraṃ caiva sa nāmaṃ nāmavarjitam || 37 ||

sa rūpaṃ rūparahitaṃ praṇavaṃ paripaṭhyate |
uccāryaṃ tu hyanuccāryaṃ svaramasvarameva ca || 38 ||

ghoṣaṃ caiva hyaghoṣaṃ ca praṇavaṃ paraśakti dhṛt |
sa mantraṃ ca hyamantraṃ ca grāhyamagrāhyameva ca || 39 ||

grāhyagrāhaka bhedena praṇavaṃ sarvataḥ sthitam |
praṇavaṃ yo na jānāti viśvasyā yatanaṃ param || 40 ||

tasya mokṣaḥ kuto vatsa kalpakoṭi śatairapi ||


