va hṛdaye vartate mahān |
<p. 4b> kasmin sthāne sthito brahmā tat samācakṣva me prabho ||


śrī īśvara uvāca 


sarvatrāvasthito brahmā prāṇināṃ dehadhārakaḥ |
viśeṣataḥ punarvatsa triṣu sthāneṣu saṃsthitaḥ || 2 ||

hṛtpadme nābhipadme tu mukhapadme tathaiva ca |
sa pratyakṣaṃ dṛśyate vai vikārāvasthitaḥ prabhuḥ || 3 ||

hasate rudate caiva nṛtyate gāyate tathā |
bhuñjate jighrate caiva śṛṇu vakṣyāmi hetutaḥ || 4 ||

unmeṣe ca nimeṣe ca viṣāde caiva harṣite |
sukhaduḥkhānyasau  vetti śītoṣṇasparśanāni ca || 5 ||

kṣuṭtṛṣṇā maithunaṃ nidrā prabodhaṃ jāgratā sthitam |
ete pratyakṣato yasya dṛśyante vai ṣaḍānana || 6 ||

nānyadīpaṃ svarūpeṇa paramātmā ca labhyate || 7 ||

<p. 5> vismayo me mahādeva adyāpi na nivartate |
tristhānāvasthitaṃ devaṃ śrotumicchāmi vai prabho || 8 ||

tuṣṭohamadyate putra yat tvayā pṛcchyate hyaham |
tristhānāvasthitaṃ brahma tacchṛṇuṣva yathākramam || 9 ||

hṛtpadme vasate nityaṃ sthirā bhāvena vai guha |
mukhapadme nābhipadme gatāgatiṃ karoti saḥ || 10 ||

hṛtpadmasya tu pattrāṇi nāḍayastāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
praṇādyā vāyavaḥ sarve vahante teṣu nāḍiṣu || 11 ||

nāḍayo vai daśa proktāḥ pavanāni tu vai daśa |
pradhānā piṅgalā śūnya sṛjate pahare tu saḥ || 12 ||

nāḍi cakrasya sarvasya nābhibhuvyavasthitam |
<p. 5b> nāḍi cakrasya vai tad vat piṅgalā madhyatodbhavā || 13 ||

iḍā caiva suṣumṇā ca piṅgalā ca tṛtīyakā |
ekakāyaṃ ca sarvāsāṃ yukti bhede pṛthak pṛthak || 14 ||

iḍā vahati vāmena tatra somo vyavasthitaḥ |
suṣupiṅgalā dakṣiṇaputra tratra sūryo vyavasthitaḥ || 15 ||

suṣumṇā madhya nāḍī tu tatra sarvaṃ sadā sthitam |
iḍāmadhye sthitaṃ deva pitṛyāneti kathyate || 16 ||

piṅgalāvasthitaṃ putra devayāneti kathyate |
suṣumṇā madhyamānāḍī tatrasthaṃ mokṣamārgadaśa || 17 ||

sarvārambheṇa yogīndro mokṣamārgapadāvahaḥ |
karṇikānta sthitaṃ devamavyaktaṃ rūpavarjitam || 18 ||

tadurthāvayava sarveyairvyāptā nāḍayodaśa |
<p. 6a> tāsāṃ madhye tu vai hyekā suṣumṇā nāma śrūyate || 19 ||

tayā proktāstrayaḥ padmāḥ sūtreṇa maṇayo yathā |
tasyābhyantarasaṃlīnau prāṇāpānau vyavasthitau || 20 ||

suṣumṇāmadhyasaṃsthau tu prāṇāpānau śikhidhvaja |
sṛṣṭipralayarūpeṇa sthitā vetau kumāraka || 21 ||

grathitau parayāśaktyā avyaktā mṛtayothayā |
ādhārādheya bhāvena parāpara vibhāgaśaḥ || 22 ||

sṛṣṭi pralaya rūpeṇa prāṇāpānau vyavasthitau |
tayormadhye sthitaṃ brahma anyaktaṃ rūpavarjitam || 23 ||

grasate sṛjate caiva sarvaṃ viśvaṃ carācaram |
nābhipadmasya vai pṛṣṭe hṛtpadmaṃ tu adho mukham || 24 ||

ubhābhyāṃ karṇikā madhye paraṃ tadvīkṣya putraka || 25 ||

<p. 6b> kathaṃ me dṛśyate tāta tasya rūpasya gocaram |
yaṃ dṛṣṭvāhaṃ gamiṣyāmi ajanma padamavyayam || 26 ||

sādhu sādhu mahāprājña yogayogeśvareśvara |
yat tvayā coditaṃ praśnaṃ durvijñeyaṃ surorapi || 27 ||

na brahmaṇā na sūryeṇa na candrena na viṣṇunā |
na tu devyā tvayā caiva yadabhya paripṛcchitam || 28 ||

tat te haṃ kathayiṣyāmi guhādguhyataraṃ param |
vikṣepa vacanaṃ rakṣeccharaṇāgatavatsvata || 29 ||

rājāmantrī varakṣyo yaṃ na deyaṃ yasya kasya cit |
adīkṣitena dātavyamaśraddheyamanārjavo || 30 ||

ākule kūrahṛdaye durjane ca dāpayet |
dātavyaṃ dīkṣate putra gurudevāgnipūjake || 31 ||

<p. 7a> śraddhadhāne jitakrodhe lobhamohaparāṅmukhe |
parīkṣyate guruḥ śiṣyamabdāni dvādaśāni vai || 32 ||

anena bhāvitaṃ viśvaṃ sarvameva carācaram || 33 ||

adyame janmasaphalaṃ adyame saphalaṃ śrutam |
adyame saphalā buddhiradyame saphalaṃ tapaḥ || 34 ||

sa kṛtārthosmi vai hṛdya adya jātosmi vai punaḥ |
muktosmi cā(?)dya vai tāta bhavasaṃsārabandhanāt || 35 ||

guhyaṃ jñānaṃ viditvā tu tṛptohaṃ sarvadā prabho |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi praṇāpānau va 


