<p. 7b> kathaṃ sthitau ||

śṛṇu vatsa mahāprājña yat tvayā codito hyaham |
tat tohaṃ kathayiṣyāmi prāṇāpānau yathā sthitau || 2 ||

prāṇādyā vāyavaḥ pañca ūrdhvabhāge vyavasthitāḥ |
teṣāṃ madhye pradhānau dvau prāṇāpānau prakīrtitau || 3 ||

kandukanyāyamāśritya adha ūrdhvaṃ pravartate |
yogamārgeṣu sarveṣu gatireṣā pravartate || 4 ||

navānāṃ caiva vāyūnāṃ prāṇāpānau prakīrtitau |
hṛtpadme nābhipadme tu dvādaśānte tathaiva ca || 5 ||

viśate paramātmā vai prāṇāpāna gati sthitaḥ |
apānaḥ saṃharet prāṇaṃ prāṇopānasya vai tathā || 6 ||

pa (***)(?) sthitaṃ teṣāṃ sṛjate saṃharatyasau |
udayāsta manaṃ hyetan nānyaṃ manye śikhidhvaja || 7 ||

<p. 8a> bāhyasaṃsthasya sūryasya nodayo vai nāstamayaḥ |
tapate satataṃ vatsa viśvaṃ diṅmārgavīkṣaṇe || 8 ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena śarīrasthaṃ vicārayet |
yaṃ jñātvā prāpyate mokṣo yena bhūyo na jāyate || 9 ||

jñātumicchamyahaṃ deva udayāsta mayaṃ katham |
ahorātraṃ kṛtaṃ caiva saṅkrānti viṣvavad dvayam || 10 ||

ati priyopi me putra pṛcchase śobhanaṃ suta |
yat tvayā coditaṃ praśnamanākhyaṃ kathayāmite || 11 ||

yan mayoktaṃ paraṃ brahma hṛdisthaṃ taṃ ṣaḍānana |
tasya śaktirbhavedeṣā udayāsta manaṃ prati || 12 ||

ūrdhvamārge yadā jvālā vartate tasya tejasaḥ |
udayaṃ taṃ vijānī 


