<p. 8b> aliṅgaṃ liṅgarūpeṇa avyaktaṃ vyaktagocaram || 9 ||

ākāśaṃ sambhavedvatsa yo vai śaktyā layaṃ gataḥ |
pṛthivyāpastathā tejo vāyurākāśa eva ca || 10 ||

ete pañca mahābhūtā yatotpannā layaṃ hi tat |
ākāśaṃ grasate śaktiryathāgrastākhilaṃ jagat || 11 ||

sṛṣṭiṃ tu kurute sā tu śivājñā coditā guha |
pralayaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ mayā te kathitaṃ suta || 12 ||

mayi coktaṃ śive nedaṃ pūrvaṃ tuṣṭena sarvadā |
bhūtotpatti layaṃ caiva mayājñātaṃ vibhāgaśaḥ |

