<p. 20a> (****************) ākāraṃ brahmasaṃsthitam || 1 ||

atiguhyatamaṃ praśnaṃ yat tvayā coditaṃ guha |
tat sarvaṃ kathayiṣyāmi śṛṇuṣvā vahitaṃ tathā || 2 ||

śūnyaṃ śūnyaṃ punaḥ śūnyaṃ śūnyaṃ śūnyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
śūnyācchūnyataraṃ śūnyaṃ tacchūnyaṃ śūnyameva ca || 3 ||

śūnyaṃ śūnyaṃ tvayā proktamanena jñānatā mama |
śūnyasyā śūnyatāṃ brūhi yadi tuṣṭosi me prabho || 4 ||

śūnyaṃ śūnyaṃ tu yo vetti śūnyaṃ śūnyaṃ tu yo bhavet |
aśūnyaṃ taṃ vijānīyāt sarvaśūnyā layaṃ hitam || 5 ||

sarvabhūteṣu taṃ vatsa triśūnyaṃ hṛdisaṃsthitam |
na tu jānanti taṃ śūnyamaśūnyā yena te kṛtāḥ || 6 ||

śūnyabhūtaṃ śivaṃ jñeyaṃ śūnyabhūtā hi śaktayaḥ ||
<p. 20b> aśūnyaṃ teṣvamīrūpaṃ sarvagaṃ cetanātmakam || 7 ||

na hi śūnyasya śūnyatvaṃ śūnyatvaṃ tasya bhāvanā |
vijñānaṃ jñāpakaṃ śūnyaṃ nirālambābalambhitam || 8 ||

vibhutvena sthitaṃ śūnyaṃ ye nedaṃ pūritaṃ jagat |
taṃ śūnyaṃ śūnyamityāhurvadanti jñānabuddhayaḥ || 9 ||

śūnyasya śūnyatā nāsti aśūnyaṃ śūnyamucyate |
sṛṣṭipralaya rohitvā cchūnyasyāśūnyatāṃ viduḥ || 10 ||

śūnyāt sṛṣṭiḥ prasavati śūnye tu pralayaṃ punaḥ |
tasmādaśūnyatā śūnye nirālambhāvalambhinam || 11 ||

nirālambhāvalambhitvaṃ śūnyatā yena siddhyati |
vijñānajñānayogena śūnyaṃ jñeyaṃ labheṣyasi || 12 ||

śūnyaṃtva śūnyaṃ jñātavyaṃ na hi śūnyosti kutra cit |
<p. 21a> teṣāṃ śūnyamidaṃ śūnyamajñānā yeṣu bhāvanā || 13 ||

aśūnyaṃ sarvadā vatsa trailokyaṃ sa carācaram |
brahmādi stambhaparyantaṃ sarvaṃ śūnyena pūritam || 14 ||

tacchūnyaṃ pūritā śaktyā avyaktā yā śivotthayā |
yathā caitanya bhāvena bodhitaṃ bhuvana trayam || 15 ||

vastu śūnyaṃ na ta cchūnyaṃ śūnyamajñānaśūnyatā |
taṃ śūnyaṃ jñāna rūpeṇa jñeyaṃ śūnyaṃ na tadguha || 16 ||

jñeya śūnyo palabdhitvaṃ nirālambāvabodhanam |
na punaḥ śūnya bhāvastu śūnyesmiṃstattvataḥ suta || 17 ||

tamo bhūtaṃ jagatsarvaṃ pūrvamāsī cchikhidhvaja |
naṣṭa sūryendu vātaughairgrahanakṣatra tārakaiḥ || 18 ||

apratarkamavijñeyaṃ diśāsu vidiśāsu ca |
na cordhvaṃ naiva pātālaṃ mahābhūtaistu varjitam || 19 ||

<p. 21b> vyaktiṃ na dṛśyate yatra avyaktaṃ sarvataḥ sthitam |
tasmin kāle tayā śaktyā cidrūpāyā śivotthitā || 20 ||

turyasthāne layaṃ kṛtvā vavarṣa hyamṛtaṃ bahu |
bhūtasṛṣṭi hitārthāya plāvitaṃ cākhilaṃ jagat || 21 ||

tadā hyaṇḍaḥ samutpannaścāṣṭāṅgaḥ kanakopamaḥ |
kalpāntaṃ yāvadaṇḍaṃ tadaṇu rūpeṇasaṃsthitam || 22 ||

sa tu vatsa dvidhā bhinno divaṃ bhūmiṃ tu nirmame |
aṣṭā śā vidiśaścāṣṭau madhye bījāṅkuraṃ padam || 23 ||

cicchaktyā tu samudbhūtaṃ ye nedaṃ grathitaṃ jagat |
tasyāṅkurasya pṛṣṭhe tu mahāpadmaṃ sitaṃ śubham || 24 ||

sahasradalapattrāḍhyaṃ karṇikākesarairyutam |
praṇavaṃ taṃ ca vijñeyaṃ padmaṃ padmadale kṣaṇam || 25 ||

<p. 22a> tasya madhye samutpanno brahmāvedanidhirguha |
karṇikānte sthitaṃ vatsa sarvalokapitāmaham || 26 ||

sṛjate sarvabhūtāni carāṇi hyacarāṇi tu |
tadā prajāpatirvatsa viśvakartā maheśvaraḥ || 27 ||

caturmukhaṃ caturbāhuṃ caturveda nidhiṃ prabhum |
sūryakoṭi pratīkāśaṃ kalpāntāgni samaprabham || 28 ||

tena tejovabhāsena bhāsitaṃ bhuvanatrayam |
vyaktībhūtaṃ tadāvatsa diśoṣṭau gaganaṃ kṣitiḥ || 29 ||

kṣitibhūtaṃ sthitaṃ padmaṃ merubhutā hi karṇikā |
dalāṣṭakaṃ diśaścāṣṭau brahmapadmasya ṣaṇmukha || 30 ||

caturdaśavidhaṃ vatsa bhūtasargaṃ carācaram |
sarvaṃ praṇavasaṃbhūtaṃ cicchaktyā cetanodbhavam || 31 ||

<p. 22b> kālāgni rudraparyantaṃ cicchaktyāṅkurasambhavam |
tacca padmasthitaṃ vatsa amṛtodadhimadhyagam || 32 ||

taṃ dṛṣṭvā tu svayaṃ brahmā vismito hyantarātmanā |
tadā tasyoditā buddhiryogamabhyamanaṃ prati || 33 ||

tena yogaṃ samabhyastaṃ divyāyutasahasrakam |
tasya yoga phalāvāptiścicchaktyā praṇave hṛtam || 34 ||

tena cotyāditaṃ sarvaṃ viśvaṃ hi sa carācaram |
brahmādi stambha paryantaṃ yāvat kālādi gocaram || 35 ||

tasmāt sākāra bhutāni sarve brahmamayāguha |
sarvaṃ ca khalvidaṃ brahmasvatorthaṃ brahma vādinam || 36 ||

jñātvā bhūta hitaṃ vatsa ye sthitāste hyasambhavāḥ |
sarveṣāṃ caiva bhūtānāṃ praṇavaṃ yoniśakti dhṛt || 37 ||

tasmād brahmasamutpannamādaupraṇava yoniṣu |
<p. 23a> praṇavena bhavet padmaṃ cicchaktyaṅkurasannibham || 38 ||

tasmin madhyātsamutpannaḥ padmayonistaducyate |
praṇavaṃ yona jānāti bindunādendu bhūṣitam || 39 ||

mātrārddhamātrasaṃyuktaṃ tena brahmavido viduḥ |
arddhamātrāsamudbhutaṃ praṇavaṃ sarvadā guha || 40 ||

nādāntāntarasaṃsthaṃ tu paraṃ brahmasanātanam |
tasminneva layaṃ kuryāt tenaivaṃ brahmavādinaḥ || 41 ||

śivāntarasamudbhuta paraṃ brahmaśikhi dhvaja |
tairjñātamamṛtaṃ teṣāmajñānaṃ ca viṣaṃ bhavet || 42 ||

ardhamātrāṇi kharvāṃśaṃ tasyāṃśaḥ koṭiraṃśakam |
tasyāpi lakṣaso hyaṃśo yojānāti sa brahmavit || 43 ||



