<p. 23b> brahmāṇḍā brahmaṇotpattiṃ mayā jñātaṃ mayā śrūtam |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi strīpuṃsoścaiva sambhavam || 1 ||

yat tvayā coditaṃ praśnaṃ durvijñeyaṃ surairapi |
tattehaṃ kathaṃyiṣyāmi rahasyaṃ praśnapūrvakam || 2 ||

yogamabhyasitaṃ pūrvaṃ sṛṣṭyarthaṃ padmayoninā |
tapaśca sumahattīrṇāṃ duṣkaraṃ cādbhutopamam || 3 ||

tadā tuṣṭaḥ sa bhagavāñśivaḥ paramakāraṇaḥ |
paraṃ brahmaśivaṃ jñeyaṃ paraṃ sthānamanāmayam || 4 ||

parāpara śivaṃ vatsa sarveṣāṃ parataḥ sthitam |
tena tuṣṭena devena cicchaktyā cetanā guha || 5 ||

gacchatvaṃ brahmaṇaḥ nārdhaṃ sṛṣṭisṛṣṭyartha kāraṇam |
<p. 24a> ārādhito hyahaṃ tena bhaktyāparamayāyadā || 6 ||

cicchaktyā coditaṃ deva pratyakṣaṃ tvaṃ kathaṃ vibho |
tadādi dṛṣṭa pūrvoyamevaṃ padma tanurbhavet || 7 ||

evaṃ matvā savai śaktiḥ śaktirūpeṇa saṃsthitā |
sa tu viṣṇurvijānīyā cchaktirūpeṇa śakti dhṛt || 8 ||

ahaṃ tu puruṣaḥ sākṣācchiva tejassamudbhavaḥ |
ubhābhyāṃ bījarūpeṇa padmayonistṛtīyakaḥ || 9 ||

evaṃ hi trividhā sṛṣṭiḥ saṃbhutābhutajā guha |
praṇavaṃ tu bhavedeṣa a u(-)makṣarayojitam || 10 ||

nādendu bindurete vai kalāmātrāstathaiva ca |
caturviṃśati tatvāni puruṣaṃ pañcaviṃśakam || 11 ||

āyuḥ karma ca vittaṃ ca vidyānidhanameva ca |
anye ye kecicchārīrā vyaktā(-)avyakta vāyavaḥ || 12 ||

<p. 24b> sarvaṃ samarasaṃ bhutvā cicchaktyāvyaktayā guha |
taṃ rasaṃ brahmamityāhurānandakaraṇaṃ param || 13 ||

śukraṃ taṃ tu vijānīyādamaratvaṃ kabho(?)tisaḥ |
sṛṣṭirūpeṇamartyānāmamaratve vyavasthitaḥ || 14 ||

devānāmamaratvaṃ ca purātenaiva kalpitaḥ |
caturdaśavidhivatsa bhūtasargaṃ carācaram || 15 ||

agre khagātmakaṃ sarvaṃ sṛṣṭabrahmādibhirguha |
brahmatejassamutpannāvagnīṣomau śikhidhvaja || 16 ||

tathā bījasya bījatvamanyathā tu nirarthakam |
evaṃ sarve samārambhāḥ sarvabījeṣu saṃsthitāḥ || 17 ||

śarīrasṛṣṭihetvarthaṃ cicchaktyā cetanātmakam |
yathānyagrodha bījānāṃ nyagrodhābhyantare sthitaḥ || 18 ||

<p. 25a> tathā sarveṣu bhūteṣu cicchaktyā cetasaṃsthitam |


