sṛṣṭinyāsaṃ mayājñātaṃ daivikaṃ caiva mānuṣam |
bhūyaśca paripṛcchāmi strīpuṃso sambhavo yathā || ||

idaṃ guhyaṃ mahāguhyaṃ sarvaguhyeṣu vai guha |
yat tvayā coditaṃ praśnaṃ tat sarvaṃ śṛṇu ṣaṇmukha || 2 ||

prāktanaiḥ karmaleśeśca śubhaiścāpya śubhaistathā |
samutpadyanti saṃsāre yoni lakṣvāntareṣu ca || 3 ||

śubhakartā śubhe yonau duṣkṛtī duṣkṛteṣu ca |
evaṃ kartā ca karmabhyo bhuñjate vai śubhā śubham || 4 ||

yadā yamaḥ sa ca bhaved yadā sṛṣṭiḥ pravartate |
<p. 26b> ubhābhyāṃ tatra saṃyogādbhagaliṅgasamāgame || 5 ||

garbhaṃ sambhavate garbhe cicchaktyā śakticodite |
yonidvārasya vai pṛṣṭhe nābhipadmaṃ sthitaṃ guha || 6 ||

yadā vikasitaṃ strīṇāma tu kālastadā bhavet |
rajaḥ pravartate hyasyāṃ divasāni tu ṣoḍaśa || 7 ||

ṛtukāle tu tat padma madhomārga mukhaṃ bhavet |
tasmin bījaṃ yadā kṣiptamṛtukāle śikhidhvaja || 8 ||

tadā tadrohate bījamanyathā rūparehitam |
puṃset karṣa bhavet puṃsaḥ striyotkarṣe bhavet striyaḥ || 9 ||

samena puṃsakaṃ jñeyamādhikye naiva kiñcana |
yugme yugānu yugme strī antakālena puṃsakam || 10 ||

ṛtukāle hyati krānte bhūyaḥ padmaṃ samaṃ bhavet |
<p. 26a> tasya madhye sthitā vatsa piṅgalādaspṛtodbhavā || 11 ||

sā nanda yati sarveṣāṃ ratikāle śikhidhvaja |
jāyate puruṣaścaivamānandayati sarvadā || 12 ||

ubhābhyāṃ samayogena tadā bījaḥ prarohati |
purapraveśametaddhi amaratvaṃ ca vai bhavet || 13 ||

tadā putrāśca pautrāśca prapautrāśca na saṃśayaḥ |
jantavo gotra santānā amaratvaṃ tadā bhavet || 14 ||

tasya padmasya madhye tu cicchaktiramṛtodbhavā |
vasate satataṃ vatsa divasāni tu ṣoḍaśaḥ || 15 ||

tadā liṅga cyutaṃ bījaṃ tasmin sthāne prarohati |
tasya padmasya garbhoyaṃ garbhaśayyā śikhidhvaja || 16 ||

padminī śaṅkha rūpeṇa garbhaśayyā sthitā guha |
tasya madhye yadā kṣiptaṃ kṣiptaṃ bījevakalpayet || 17 ||

<p. 26b> anyathā tu abījeyamauṣadhaṃ kṣipitaṃ yathā || ||


