sarvaṃ deva mayā jñātaṃ sarvaṃ tāta mayā śrūtam |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi rajoretaḥ samudbhavam ||

atyanta kutsitaṃ putra yat tvayā paripṛcchitam |
duṣkṛtīnāṃ ca sarvāsāṃ garbhavāsaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 2 ||

kālāgni rudra paryantaṃ yāvadbrahmāṇḍagocaram |
sarvaṃ cicchaktinā vyāptaṃ śivājñā coditaṃ guha || 3 ||

cicchakti saṃplutā bhūtāḥ sarveṣāmantare sthitāḥ |
prarohaṃ kuru vṛddhiṃ ca anyathā tasya codanam || 4 ||

<p. 27a> vyaktaṃ na dṛśyate tasya avyakta tvāt sṛjatyasau |
tasya bījaṃ kurutyantā tayā sṛṣṭaṃ carācaram || 5 ||

carāṇāmacarāṇāṃ ca bhūtānāṃ śikhivāhana |
yosau yoniḥ sanidhanaṃ paramārthaṃ tu taṃ viduḥ || 6 ||

paramārthaṃ tu taṃ jñeyaṃ yasya śaktirna lupyate |
śaktirna lupyate cāsya śivayogā śikhidhvaja || 7 ||

sarveṣāmeva bhūtānāṃ yonyaṇḍa svedajodbhijaḥ |
agnīṣomānilayutaṃ viśate parameśvaraḥ || 8 ||

utpattireṣā bhūtānāṃ prāṇāpānodayena tu |
astaṅgataistairnidhanaṃ dehe deheśvaro guha || 9 ||

ādau bhūtāḥ samutpannāḥ paścādaṇḍasya sambhavaḥ |
tatoṅkuraṃ ca padmaṃ ca tatva brahmādanantaram || 10 ||

caturviṃśati tatvāni akṣatāni tu vai guha |
gāyatrī tu bhavet taistu mahādevāti nissṛtam || 11 ||

<p. 27b> te naiva nissṛtaṃ viśvaṃ karmayugmasamanvitam |
cicchakti saṃbhavaṃ sarvaṃ brahmāṇḍa kuharodaram || 12 ||

tasmād vai sarvadā vatsa cicchaktiḥ paramārthataḥ |
mayā sṛṣṭaṃ jagatsarvaṃ bhūtasargaṃ carācaram || 13 ||

strīrajo retasaṃ miśraṃ kalilaṃ māsamekataḥ |
cicchaktyā cetanodbhūtaṃ dvitīye māsi budbudam || 14 ||

retoraktasamudbhūtaṃ tṛtīye māsi ṣaṇmukha |
cicchakti sambhavā hyata sarveṣāmantare sthitāḥ || 15 ||

prarohāṅkura vṛttiṃ ca sarveṣāṃ tasya cetanāḥ |
vyaktirna dṛśyate tasya avyakta tvāt sṛjatyasau || 16 ||

tasya bījāṅkurasyāntaṃ tena dṛṣṭaṃ carācaram |
carāṇā(?)macarāṇāṃ ca bhūtānāṃ śikhivāhana || 17 ||

<p. 28a> budbudhāṅkurasaṃlīnaṃ cicchaktiḥ sṛjateṅkuram |
taṃ nālaṃ padmagarbhasya nābhinālaṃ prakīrtitam || 18 ||

tatomāṃsāsthi saṃbhutistṛtīye māsi ṣaṇmukha |
yathā bījāṅkuraṃ vatsa avyaktaṃ naiva dṛśyate || 19 ||

caturthe māsi saṃprāpte jāyante vayavāṅkurāḥ |
tadā vyaktaṃ bhavet kāyaṃ puruṣā kṛti saṃjñakam || 20 ||

cicchaktyā cetanaṃ tasya jāyante stokamātrakam |
majjāsthi snāyumedhaṃ ca māṃsaṃ rudirameva ca || 21 ||

vātapittaṃ tathā śleṣmaṃ śukraṃ mūtra purīṣayoḥ |
sirānāḍī granthayaśca dvārāḥ kūrmāśca jālakāḥ || 22 ||

tvacaṃ marmāṇi sandhīścalomanāḍyastathaiva ca |
ete cānyepi ye keciccharīrotpatti kāraṇam || 23 ||

<p. 28b> sambhavanti ca sarve vai aṅgānyavayavāstathā (dehasyā) |
pañcame māsi samaye na khalomāni spandanam || 24 ||

śrottraśuktiśca śotrāṇāṃ dhātūnāṃ dhāturopaṇam |
vyaktatvaṃ sarvamaṅgānāṃ yathā yasya tu kalpitam || 25 ||

cicchakti cetanavaśāt sampannāste śikhidhvaja |
ṣaṣṭhe māsi rasān sarvān yadā te mātṛ bhojanāt || 26 ||

kṣuṭtṛṣṇā jāgranidrāśca śītoṣṇa mukhaduḥkhitāḥ |
cicchakti cetanorthe na cetanāṃ cetate tu yaḥ || 27 ||

saptame māsi saṃprāpte caitanyaṃ mānuṣopamam |
yadā prabudhyate cāgnirhyadisthaṃ tacca vai guha || 28 ||

tadā sa sarvamakhilaṃ śarīre dyotayatyasau |
padmatrayaṃ prabuddhyeta hyannābhi mukhasaṃsthitam || 29 ||

<p. 29a> vāyavaśca pravartante prāṇādyā ye prakīrtitāḥ |
liṅgadyānāḍayaḥ sarvā hṛtpadmadalasambhavāḥ || 30 ||

tānimāṃ pūritaṃ sarvaṃ tejorthena jarāyubhiḥ |
tairvyāptamakhilaṃ piṇḍaṃ lomāntaṃ yāvat ṣaṇmukha || 31 ||

nāḍi cakraṃ tu sarvaṃ vai vyāpitaṃ sarvarasmibhiḥ |
yathā sūryodaye sarvaṃ rasmibhirvyāpitaṃ jagat || 32 ||

pāṇāgni sūryau nirṇītvā vyāpitaṃ dehamātmanaḥ |
cicchakti cetanorthāṃya bahiḥ sūryaṃ śikhidhvaja || 33 ||

na tu tasyātmanāśaktiryāvaccicchakti coditā |
aṣṭamena tu māsena buddhirgarbhasya saṃbhavet || 34 ||

yathāhaṅkāra doṣeṇa garbhavāsaṃ vasāmyaham |
tamondhakāragahane sarvaduḥkhasamākule || 35 ||

<p. 29b> svedamūtrapurīṣorthe vasārudhirasaṃyute |
kaliśseṣmasaṅkīrṇe māṃsāsthisnāyu saṅkaṭe || 36 ||

ekaviṃśati ye proktā narakāśca bhayāvahāḥ |
teṣāṃ madhyānmahāghoraṃ narakaṃ kukṣi sambhavam || 37 ||

candrārkarahitaṃ bhīmaṃ vāyvagni parivarjitam |
narakārṇavasaṃprakhyaṃ duḥkhakalloladussaham || 38 ||

ahaṃ jātaḥ kathaṃ putra kiṃ mayā duṣkṛtaṃ kṛtam |
evaṃ sañcintyamānasya cicchaktyā coditasya ca || 39 ||

navame māsi samaye saṃprāpteṣu saveguha |
ata ūrddhvaṃ tu ye kecit garbhavāse vasanti ca || 40 ||

mahāpātakinaste vai upapātakinastu ye |
darśanaṃ daśame māsi sukṛtāni tu cintayet || 41 ||

<p. 30a> yenāhaṃ santariṣyāmi yonidvārādbhayānakāt |
tadahaṃ tat kariṣyāmi yena bhuyo na jāyate || 42 ||

sukṛtāni hyaśeṣāṇi yāni vai kathitāni tu |
vedeṣu sarvaśāstreṣu purāṇeṣu smṛtīṣu ca || 43 ||

tāni sarvān kariṣyāmi yathoktāni vidhānataḥ |
evaṃ sañcintya mānasya cicchaktyā prasavaṃ kṛtam || 44 ||

mahābhayaṃ tu garbhasya prasavaṃ tu śikhidhvaja |
atyanta bhayabhītā tu maṇḍa udbijitā guha || 45 ||

hastapādaśarīreṇa svakena śikhivāhana |
vidārya padmaṃ garbhasya yonidvāra mukhe gatam || 46 ||

tadāmātā bhayaṃ prāptā maraṇāntika gocaram |
<p. 30b> vidārya sṛṣṭiṃ dvāreṇa mātuḥ sandeha kārakam || 47 ||

nirgatya patate bhūmau nissaṃjñaṃ tu tadā bhavet |
na tasya sukṛte buddhirna ca duṣkṛta karmaṇi || 48 ||

mohito māyayā vatsa cicchaktyā bālasaṃjñayā |
utpattireṣābhūtānāṃ yonijānāṃ śikhidhvaja || 49 ||

tasmāt sarva prayatnena ajātapadamabhyaset || ||


