na kiñcidapi taṃ deva yanmayānāvadhāritam |
tatrāpi saṃśayaṃ deva vartate dhātu saṅkṣayāt || 1 ||

atyanta gahanaṃ praśnamapratyakṣamagocaram |
<p. 31a> yat tvayā coditaṃ praśnaṃ putrasnehādvadāmite || 2 ||

pañcabhautika piṇḍasya cicchaktyā nirmitasya ca |
yathā vai dhātu saṃkhyānamaṅgānāṃ ca śṛṇuṣvame || 3 ||

ṣaḍrasāhāratṛptasya dhātusantarpitasya ca |
rasaṃ sambhavate vatsa māsamekaṃ tu niṣphalā || 4 ||

taṃ rasaṃ rasarūpeṇa cicchaktyā hyamṛtaṃ kṛtam |
parāgni saṃbhavaṃ taṃ vai na sa śukro bhavatyasau || 5 ||

sṛṣṭibījaṃ tu taṃ jñeyaṃ tataḥ sṛṣṭiḥ pravartate |
rasādraktaṃ tato māṃsaṃ māṃsānmedotha jāyate || 6 ||

medasosthi tathā majjā majjā cchūkraṃ ca jāyate |
śukrāddhātūni sarvāṇi dhātubhyāṃ dehamānuṣam || 7 ||

teṣāṃ santarpaṇaṃ tuṣṭi rasatarpaṇato vyayam |
evaṃ hi prathamaṃ tāvaccharīrotpatti kāraṇam || 8 ||

<p. 31b> anantaraṃ punarvatsa yathā bhavati tacchṛṇu |
vātaṃ pittaṃ tathā śleṣmaṃ dhātavaḥ parikīrtitāḥ || 9 ||

viṇmūtra śukramajjā tu māṃsaṃ caivāṣṭamaṃ viduḥ |
śarīradhāraṇā hyete saṅkhyāsaṅkhyā kṛtāṃ guṇāḥ || 10 ||

dhātu sāmye sthitā dehe sarve te guṇakārakāḥ |
tāsāṃ saṅkhyā bhavedeṣā kalpanā śikhivāhana || 11 ||

viparyayeṇa dhātūnāṃ na hi saṅkhyā bhavet guha |
vāyu bhāve guṇā ye ca ye vāne yau dhvane tathā || 12 ||

na tu madhya vayotīta samatvaṃ sarvadhātuṣu |
atorthā dhātu pūrvāye asaṅkhyeyāvilāguha || 13 ||

sthito yo sau hṛdi hyagniḥ praṇavorthaḥ śikhidhvaja |
tena santarpite naiva dhātavastarpitā guha || 14 ||

sa śṛṇoti sa vai paśyed yo rasān svādate ciram |
<p. 32a> sa tu gandha guṇasparśaṃ bhuñjate dehasaṃsthitaḥ || 15 ||

tasya bhāvāt pralīyante sarve te dhātavaḥ sadā |
tasmād vai sarvadā vatsa sa kartāsevakāraṇam || 16 ||

yathā rasmi sahasrāṇi sūryāyattāni ṣaṇmukha |
tathā sarvāṇi bhūtāni te jāyattāni sarvaśaḥ || 17 ||


