dātūtpattirmayā jñātā yathā tathyaṃ suvistaram |
sarveṣāmeva dhātūnāṃ raktaṃ tu prathamaṃ bhavet |
sa tu māṃsaṃ samāśritya saṃsthitaṃ sarvadehinām || 2 ||

tasya majjā bhavedvatsa paladvātriṃśa saṃkhyayā |
<p. 32b> māṃsaṃ peśīśatānyaṣṭau śataiketaiva cādhikaḥ || 3 ||

payaḥ pītvā bhaved raktaṃ dviguṇaṃ taṃ śikhidhvaja |
pittasya tu palānyaṣṭau śleṣmarakta samāśritam || 4 ||

raktasya hi samaṃ śleṣmaṃ tadvadvṛttistu ṣaṇmukha |
vasāmedaḥ pṛthaktvena ubhau viṃśatpalīnakau || 5 ||

śukraṃ pittaṃ samaṃ jñeyaṃmasthimajjāntareṣu ca |
vasādāhārapānāṃbhyāṃ viṇmūtraṃ jāyate punaḥ || 6 ||

tadā bhāvai hyasaṃkhyeyaṃ sthiratvaṃ teṣu naiva ca |
raktaṃ pittaṃ tathā śleṣmaṃ śukraṃ majjā tu ṣaṇmukha || 7 ||

rasodbhavāni caitāni rasabhāvā tu naiva hi |
sarveṣāmeva dhātūnāṃ pittaṃ vai śleṣma bandhanam || 8 ||

yasmādrasodbhavāḥ sarve tadā teṣāṃ nibandhanam |
yasmādrasodbhavāḥ sarve tadā teṣāṃ nibandhanam || 9 ||

<p. 33a> majjāyāṃ tu palāviṃśat sarvāsthyabhyantare sthitāḥ |
asthīnāṃ tu śatāṃ trīṇi ṣaṣṭhya sthiradhikāni ca || 10 ||

tantrīṇāṃ caiva vijñeyaṃ śatamaṣṭādhikaṃ tathā |
aṣṭottaraṃ carmaśataṃ sirāṇāṃ sapta vai śatam || 11 ||

tāśca rakta vahāḥ sarvā dehamācchādyasaṃsthitāḥ |
granthīnāṃ tu śataṃ vatsa aṣṭātriṃśottaraṃ tathā || 12 ||

pradhānā granthayaḥ pañca yaiḥ kāryaṃ mokṣasādhane |
snāyu jālamasaṃkhyeyaṃ yairbaddhaṃ kāyapañjaram || 13 ||

māṃsaṃ tu dhāryate taistu saṅkoca karaṇāni te |
catuṣṣaṣṭirbhavet kūrcaṃ tayoḥ snāyūṃśca sambhavet || 14 ||

sūcitātā bhavet ṣaṣṭiḥ snāyu sūtraistu yantritam |
tadā yantra mayaṃ sarvaṃ śarīraṃ mānuṣātmakam || 15 ||

<p. 33b> dvāsaptati sahasrāṇi nāḍīnāṃ parikīrtitam |
tāstu vāyu vahāḥ sarvāssarvāstā mokṣadāḥ śubhāḥ || 16 ||

tāsāṃ madhye pradhānaikā piṅgalā amṛtodbhavā |
tadudbhavāṇi sarvāṇi yathā prāṇodbhavānilāḥ || 17 ||

carmamekaṃ tu vikhyātaṃ roma cchannaṃ samantataḥ |
tisraḥ koṭyo va koṭistu romasaṅkhyaḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 18 ||

te ca nāḍi samudbhūtā yasmāt tejodbhavāni te |
te saṅkhye yā asaṅkhye yā ye tu dehāntare sthitā || 19 ||

sarve tejaḥ samudbhūtā sarve te tejasaṃsthitāḥ |
lomakrāmāni sarvāṇi dvārāṇi śikhivāhana || 20 ||

ajñānānnaiva dṛśyante dṛśyante jñāna cakṣuṣā |
<p. 34a> nakhānāṃ viṃśatiḥ proktā navadvārāṇi ṣaṇmukha || 21 ||

evaṃ saṅkhyā samudbhūtā śarīreṣu śarīriṇām || 22 ||


