avayavānāṃ tu sarveṣāṃ saṅkhyotpattirmayā śrūtā |
bhūyo vijñātu micchāmi brahmaveśma śarīrajām || 1 ||

sarve praśnā mayāproktā rahasyāni tu sarvasaḥ |
yasmādbrahma mayaṃ dehamatrabrahma tu labhyate || 2 ||

avayavāḥ pūrvamuktā mayā caivaṃ śikhidhvaja |
yadyekona bhavet teṣāṃ tadā sarve hyapārthakāḥ || 3 ||

prāktanānabhavantyete saṃhatādeha dhārakāḥ |
<p. 34b> ekaikaṃ ca tathā bhūtamutpannaṃ śakti coditam || 4 ||

punareva tu te naiva yantritaṃ bhūta pañjaram |
tasmād yantra mayaṃ sarvaṃ śarīraṃ mānuṣātmakam || 5 ||

gṛhakṛtyasamādṛśyamasthidā rucitaṃ śubham |
māṃsarakta mṛdādigdhaṃ snāyu kīlaka kīlitam || 6 ||

lipte vai carma lepena navadvāropaśobhitam |
ekona dhāryate stambhaṃ brahmāṇḍaṃ yena dhāryate || 7 ||

brahmaveśma sadāvatsa tasmin madhye paraṃ sthitam |
brahmaṇo veśmano madhye vedamagni trayasya ca || 8 ||

teṣāṃ homaṃ prakurvīta pratyahaṃ cāhitāgninā |
ājyendha na tilairdarbhairdhūmairgandhaiḥ srajaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 9 ||

na teṣāṃ tuṣṭipuṣṭirvāhutaistairjīvasaṃjñakaiḥ |
tuṣyante tarpitāvatsa prāṇāpānāhutīṣu ca || 10 ||

<p. 35a> na teṣāṃ hūyate havyamajīvaṃ brahmasaṃbhavam |
juhuyāt satataṃ vatsa prāṇāpānāvamṛtodbhavau || 11 ||

turyasthānāmṛtaṃ vatsa vasudhārevasaṃsthitam |
sravate satataṃ vatsa prāṇāgnau tarpaṇaṃ prati || 12 ||

agnayastena tṛpyanti ājyendha na nirarthakāḥ |
bāhyāgnītamupāsīta vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā || 13 ||

bhurbhuvaḥ svastapolokā dṛśyante tairhutākhilāḥ |
brahmavedirbhavedeṣā brahmaveśmasya madhyataḥ || 14 ||

antarvedī tathātraiva suṣumṇā trāntare sthitā |
prayāgaṃ ca kurukṣettraṃ puṣkaraṃ naimiṣaṃ tathā || 15 |

vārāṇasī tathā gaṅgā kedāraṃ sindhu sāgaram |
ete cānyepi ye kecit tīrthānyāyatanāni ca ||

<p. 35b> sarve tiṣṭhanti brahmajña paramāgnau juhoti yaḥ |
sarvaṃ sarveṣu bhūteṣu prakaṭaṃ saṃsthitaṃ guha ||

ajñānānnaiva paśyanti paśyanti jñāna cakṣuṣā || ||


(?????????????????????)

brahmaveśma tathājyaṃ ca tvat prasādācchrutaṃ mayā |
adhunā śrotu micchāmi brahmabrahmapuresthitam ||

sarvaṃ sarvaṃ mayākhyātaṃ yat tvayā pṛcchitaṃ guha |
ayaṃ praśno gurorvaktrādyadi jñāsyasi niścayāt ||

rahasyaṃ sarva śāstreṣu vedādi sahiteṣu ca |
siddhānte kula siddhānte avācyaṃ yat kathaṃ ca te || 3 ||

nityoditaṃ ca nityaṃ ca anityaṃ kalpanātmakam |
<p. 36a> yat tvayā coditaṃ vatsa ati snehādbadāmite || 4 ||

yo sau hyadi sthitaḥ padmaḥ praṇavortthaḥ śikhidhvaja |
tasya madhye paraṃ tejo yaḥ paśyati sa paśyati || 5 ||

mahājvālā samākīrṇaṃ raśmibhiḥ parivāritam |
asaṅkhyā bhāsurābhāsaṃ brahmaveśmasya dīpanam || 6 ||

taṃ ca paśyati yaḥ putra taṃ ca brahma vido viduḥ |
nadate satataṃ yasmāt tasmān nādamihocyate || 7 ||

pravāhena sthitaṃ vatsa yathā nadyo jalāśayāḥ |
abyucchinnaṃ ca taṃ nādaṃ nadate sarva dehinām || 8 ||

dehe dehe na cānyo vai ekaṃ vai sarvataḥ sthitam |
anacchaṃ kecidicchanti śūnyaṃ kecitva danti ca || 9 ||

mātrārdhamātraṃ kecicca nāsti nāstīti nāstikāḥ |
<p. 36b> taṃ nādaṃ prakaṭaṃ yeṣāṃ teṣāṃ mokṣo dhruvaṃ guha || 10 ||

dhūlibhedena te siddhaṃ siddhaṃ gurumukhācchubham |
tvāṃ viditvā mahāsenaṃ taṃ mokṣaṃ prāpsyase dhurvam || 11 ||

dhruvaṃ bhavedbhavedvatsa dhruvarūpeṇasaṃsthitam |
paramāgni samudbhūtaṃ taṃ nādaṃ nadate guha || 12 ||

tacca darśayate vastu sa gururgurureva ca |
daiśikastu sa vijñeyo mokṣo vai mokṣikastu saḥ || 13 ||

lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu nādasya yathātvaṃ lakṣayiṣyasi |
yena vijñāta mātreṇa bhrānti jñānaṃ nivartate || 14 ||

yathendhanapradīptegnau yathākṣobha cyutaṃ jale |
yathā vātāhate vṛkṣe śabdoyaṃ śrūyate guha || 15 ||

tathā śarīra brahmoyaṃ pratyakṣaṃ śṛṇu ṣaṇmukha |
śṛṅgadhvani ninādena nadantaṃ yaḥ śṛṇoti vai || 16 ||

<p. 37a> taṃ nādaṃ brahmamityāhuryaḥ śṛṇoti śṛṇoti saḥ |
na kiñcidapi taṃ vatsa yasya taṃ na hyadi sthitam || 17 ||

na tu jānanti taṃ mūḍhā jñāna vijñāna varjitāḥ |
prakaṭaṃ jñāna cakṣurbhyāṃ paśyate śṛṇute tu saḥ || 18 ||

tarjanī prāntasaṃruddhau karṇau dvaukārayedguha |
etena śrūyate nādaṃ na dantaṃ brahmasaṃbhavam || 19 ||

evaṃ vai paramaṃ nādaṃ hṛdisthaṃ sarvadehinām |
brahmādi stambha paryantamākārā ye bhavanti vai || 20 ||

teṣāṃ hṛdi sthitaṃ vatsa guruvaktrāt tu labhyate |
gurūpadeśagamyoyaṃ yadi tuṣṭo vadatyasau || 21 ||

anyathā na tu siddhyeta kalpakoṭi śatairapi |
sa tṛptaḥ sa ca vai muktaḥ somṛtaṃ cāśnute dhruvam || 22 ||

<p. 37b> yasyedaṃ viditaṃ brahma paraspara padānugam |
paraṃparagataṃ vatsa parātparataraṃ hitam || 23 ||

taṃ ca nādaṃ samākhyātaṃ yena vyāptaṃ carācaram |
brahmādi sarva bhūteṣu careṣu hyacareṣu ca || 24 ||

hṛdisthaṃ nadate nādaṃ prāṇādyā vāyavekhilāḥ |
vyāpāreṣu sa vai kartā samastavyastakeṣu ca || 25 ||

sa kartā sa hi vijñeyastvaṃ tarhya na gato guha |
sarve ye kecid vyāpārāḥ sṛṣṭirādyāḥ kṣayāntikāḥ || 26 ||

sa kartā caiva sarveṣā paraṃ brahma sadoditam |
caturviṃśati tattvāni puruṣaḥ pañcaviṃśakaḥ || 27 ||

sarveṣāṃ sa hi kartā vai tadā yat tāni tāni tu |


(???????????????)

<p. 38a> sarvaṃ sarvaṃ mayā jñātaṃ sarvaṃ sarvaṃ mayā śrutam |
na punastāta kauleyaṃ khecarīṇāṃ mukhesthitam || 1 ||

mahājñānamidaṃ vatsa mahāvijñānameva ca |
yat tvayā coditaṃ praśnaṃ kaulaṃ khecari gocaram || 2 ||

putra snehāt kathiṣyāmi rahasyamadbhūtopamam |
taṃ hi siddhyanti tāsāṃ vai tāstasmiṃstejasā guha || 3 ||

sāmānyānāṃ tu martyānāṃ lokopahata cetasām |
kuvikalpagatānāṃ vai satyaṃ vatsa na siddhyati || 4 ||

jīvākhyamamṛtaṃ yacca hṛdākāśāntare sthitam |
pibanti rūpikāstaṃ tu nāḍimāśritya madhyamām || 5 ||

taṃ pītvā tṛpti māyānti atorthaṃ taṃ pibanti hi |
devān pitṛstarpayanti kulanāḍyāṃsta saṃsthitāḥ || 6 ||

tāsāṃ mokṣaṃ śivenoktamanena vidhinā guha |
na punarhomahavanairyajñaiśca bahudakṣiṇaiḥ || 7 ||

māṃsāsthi rudhiraṃ majjāṃ bhakṣayanti ca rūpikāḥ |
vivarte hyamṛtaṃ vatsa hṛdisthaṃ yatparaṃ padam || 8 ||

siddhisteṣāṃ tu te naiva tarpayitvā tu bhairavam |
bhairavastarpitaṃ tāsāṃ dharme ca paśuṃ prokṣaṇe || 9 ||

cicchaktiḥ paśavasteṣāṃ hṛnmadhyasaṃsthitā |
mokṣaśca nihitaṃ yajñe bhairavokteṣu sarvadā || 10 ||

pihitaṃ taṃ tu vijñeyamanyathā vada eva tu |
anena vidhinā vatsa hiṃsanti paśavo yadi || 11 ||

samuktaḥ paśunāsārdhaṃ mokṣa ityabhidhīyate |
<p. 39a> siddhyate mahatāṃ siddhiraṣṭasiddhisamanvitā || 12 ||

sāmānyānāṃ tu siddhīnāṃ koviśeṣosti śakti dhṛt |
kasyedaṃ viditaṃ jñānaṃ jñeyaṃ vijñāna sammitam || 13 ||

brahmādyāḥ paśavastasya paśoranyasya kā kathā |
paśūnāṃ caiva sarveṣāmādikartā prajāpatiḥ || 14 ||

sa eva prokṣito yasmāt tasmāt kaulodhikaṃ bhavet |
vedayajñeṣu paśavo hiṃsanti brāhmaṇottamāḥ || 15 ||

bhairavīyeṣu sarveṣu puṃpaśuṃ hanti sādhakāḥ |
sūkṣmapuryaṣṭakaṃ yacca bhūtānāṃ hṛdi saṃsthitam || 16 ||

taṃ paśuṃ hanti yoginyo hatvā siddhyanti siddhiṣu |
prāṇāpānodaye tasmin bindunāda layaṃ gatāḥ || 17 ||

pibanti rūpikāstāstu paśuṃ hatvāśikhidhvaja |
gatireṣā hi caiteṣāṃ tadātmetaṃ labhanti hi || 18 ||

<p. 39b> jīvavyomāntaraṃ yacca bhūtānāṃ hṛdisaṃsthitam |
prāṇāpānapravāhena na viditvā pibanti hi || 19 ||

sadyo nirdhānadīrtā(?) vai mokṣakastu (****) |
(****************) bhakṣyāni kāni tu || 20 ||

pibanti yena siddhyarthaṃ vidhinā bhairavena tu |
bhairavoktena vidhinā samyag yoga balena tu || 21 ||

pibanti madirāṃ tu kṣīravatprakaṭaṃ guha |
sa siddhaḥ sādhakaḥ sohi śeṣā vai madhyamāḥ smṛtāḥ || 22 ||

puṣpamātreṇa prāpyenaṃ bahūnāṃ yastu nirvapet |
kṣīraṃ tu kurute madhyaṃ saṃśaye samupasthite || 23 ||

sa siddhaḥ sarvadā vatsa kṛṣṇaḥ śveta karo guha |
prāṇāpānāntara caronāḍi tritaya yāyinaḥ || 24 ||

taṃ pibanta mṛtaṃ divyaṃ paraṃ paramasiddhidam |
<p. 40a> sauraṃmārgaṃ parityajya cāndraṃ mārgaṃ tathaiva ca || 25 ||

brahmamārga gamaṃ yasya taṃ pibaṃtya mṛtaṃ param ||


(???????????)

vadame yadi tuṣṭosi iṣṭaṃ tathyaṃ hitaṃ vibho |
yena vijñāta mātreṇa bhrānti jñānaṃ nivartate || 1 ||

śṛṇu vatsa yathānyāyyaṃ sarvaprājñottamottama |
yat tvayā coditaṃ praśnaṃ nissandigdhaṃ vadāmyaham || 2 ||

yā sā śaktiḥ parāsūkṣmā avyaktā yā śivorthayā |
saṃsthitā sarvabhūteṣu jagadurddhraṃ(?) yayākhilam || 3 ||

brahmādi stambha paryantaṃ bhūtasargaṃ carācaram |
grasate sṛjate śaktiśśivājñā jñāpitā guha || 4 ||

na punaḥ śaktirasmākaṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ śikhidhvaja |
vayaṃ pitāmahaṃ viṣṇuṃ na bīndvanalameva ca || 5 ||

indrādyā devatāḥ sarve satvādyāśca maharṣayaḥ |
bhūyo bhūyo hi jāyante bhūyo bhūyo mriyanti ca || 6 ||

na punaḥ śakti saṃhāro bhavatiha kadācana |
śaktirna lupyate sā vai paramādvaita vartinī || 7 ||

nityoditā tu sā sūkṣmā śivāmṛtasamudbhavā |
yayāvyāptamidaṃ viśvaṃ bhūtasargaṃ carācaram || 8 ||

antargatā tu sā vatsa sarveṣāṃ hṛdi saṃsthitā |
ekaikaṃ maṇimāśritya yathāviddhyanti vedhakāḥ || 9 ||

mahābhūtāni vai tadvacchaktibodhena bodhitā |
sūtraṃ tāsāṃ śivaṃ sākṣāt tena te grathitā guha || 10 ||

<p. 41a> yairvyāptamakhilaṃ viśvaṃ brahmāṇḍāvadhi gocaram |
mahābhūtāni sarvāṇi sarve cicchakti sambhavāḥ || 11 ||

cicchaktiśśivasambhūtā avyaktāḥ sarvataḥ sthitāḥ |
na hi jānanti tāṃ mūḍhā mahāmāyā vimohitāḥ || 12 ||

na kaścidapi taṃ bhūtaṃ yasya sā hṛdi na sthitā |
sthitā sā agni rūpeṇa sarvatra vāyunāśritā || 13 ||

te paśyanti hitāvatsa yeṣāṃ jñānaṃ munirmalam |
brahmaveśma bhaved dehaṃ jñānaṃ tatraiva dīpakam || 14 ||

taṃ prajvālya prapaśyanti yatkiñcidveśmamadhyagam |
taṃ dṛṣṭyā te gamiṣyanti ajanma padamavyayam || 15 ||

ajā sā amalā sūkṣmā nityoditā sunirmalā |
saṃsthitā sarvabhūtānāṃ brahmādīnāṃ śikhidhvaja || 16 ||

<p. 41b> yairjñātāste vimuktā vai te baddhā yantra lakṣitāḥ |
vayaṃ brahmādibhissārdhaṃ naiva muktāḥ śikhidhvaja || 17 ||

tadā dhyānāvasakrā vai tasya dhyāna parāyaṇāḥ |
anyepi yoginaḥ sarve makṣamārgānu kāṅkṣiṇaḥ || 18 ||

yajanti vividhairyajñaistanmadhyāduditaṃ guha |
kāraṇaṃ tatra vai hyekaṃ yukti bhedaḥ pṛthak pṛthak || 19 ||

sātvikaṃ yeṣu vai yogaṃ teṣāṃ mokṣo bhaveddhruvam |
rājasaṃ svargakāmānāṃ nārakaṃ tamasā vṛtam || 20 ||

sātvikaṃ caiva tairyaṣṭaṃ tadā te mokṣa yāyinaḥ |
rājasaṃ mānuṣairvatsa svargā vāpti phalapradam || 21 ||

tāmasaṃ tiryagyonisthairmūḍhairajñairapaṇḍitaiḥ |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena sātvikaṃ yāgamārabhet || 22 ||

rājasaṃ tāmasaṃ vatsa punarāvṛtti kārakam |
<p. 42a> sātvikaṃ mānasaṃ yāgaṃ tatra hiṃsā na vidyate || 23 ||

rājasaṃ tāmasaṃ vatsa ubhautau hiṃsa pūrvakau |
mānase naiva yāgena ye yajanti sadāśivam || 24 ||

te muktāḥ sarvapāpebhyaḥ satyaṃ satyamupāsuta |
dravyaśuddhistu paramaṃ sambhāraṃ yeṣu krīyate || 25 ||

tāṃ vicāraya yatnena sātvikaṃ bhavate yadi |
tadā taṃ dravya sambhāraṃ śuddho bhavati ṣaṇmukha || 26 ||

rājasaṃ tāmasaṃ dravyamaśuddhaṃ sarvadā gamaiḥ |
yaṣṭaṃ hi nirmalaṃ tena pratyutatṛṇavadbhavet || 27 ||

sātvikaṃ nāsti tad dravyaṃ triṣu lokeṣu sarvadā |
tadarthaṃ na vimuktāste ye yajanti sadā dhanaiḥ || 28 ||

athavā sātvikaṃ cārthaṃ yadi labhet kathañcana |
<p. 42b> tad deyaṃ devagurave vipre vā brahmavādine || 29 ||

anantaṃ ca asaṅkhyeyaṃ svalpamātre paśoditam |
akṣayyaṃ bhavate vatsa kalpakoṭi śatairapi || 30 ||

sambhārārthaṃ na tad dravyaṃ prayuñjīta kadācana |
saṃbhārā ye bahirkecit sarve cicchakti sambhavāḥ || 31 ||

teṣāṃ bādhā bhaved yasmāt tasmāt tāṃ parivarjayet |
sa jīvāni tu te sarve śivaṃ teṣāṃ hṛdi sthitam || 32 ||

sa jīvāni tu puṣpāṇi sa jīvāni phalāni ca |
sa jīvāḥ paśavo jñeyāstarujātīnisarvaśaḥ || 33 ||

tāṃ tyaktvā yajasekastvaṃktayāgamaghasiddhimān |
ye sthitāḥ phalasandho (*)(?) vaśyākarṣaṇamāraṇaiḥ || 34 ||

te yajanti sa jīvaistu jīvaiścicchakti sambhavaiḥ | 
<p. 43a> caturdaśavidhaṃ vatsa bhūtasargaṃ carācaram || 35 ||

sarvaṃ cicchaktisaṃbhūtaṃ taṃ hatvā naiva mucyate || ||




śaktyodayaṃ mayājñātaṃ dravyaśuddhivinirṇayam |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi iṣṭamiṣṭoturottaram || 1 ||

mayātīrṇaṃ tapaścograṃ yugakalpānyanekaśaḥ |
tadā sa tuṣṭo bhagavāñśivopyaśivahāparaḥ || 2 ||

vadate vadame cādya tuṣṭohaṃ te umāpatiḥ |
ahiṃsā sarvabhūteṣu careṣu hyacareṣu ca || 3 ||

etaddhi cāmṛtaṃ vatsa akṣaraṃ hyakṣaraṃ dhruvam |
hiṃsākṣaraṃ vijānīyāt tasmāt taṃ parivarjayet || 4 ||

atorthaṃ mānusaṃ yāgamakṣaraṃ hyamṛtaṃ guha |
ye yajanti hitaṃ vatsa te muktā bhavabandhanāt || 5 ||

vayaṃ bhogābhilāṣeṇa naivamuktāḥ śikhidhvaja |
ajñānādupadeśasya śivajñāna bahiṣkṛtaḥ || 6 ||

tadānu viditaṃ tattvaṃ mokṣamārgāvalambinam |
niṣprapañcaṃ paraṃ tatvamaparaṃ tu parāparam || 7 ||

niṣprapañcā parāśaktirniṣprapañcaḥ paraḥ śivaḥ |
tasya yāgaṃ ca kurvīta niṣprapañcaṃ hi mānusam || 8 ||

snānaṃ dhyānaṃ tathā pūjā japaṃ homaṃ tu pañcamam |
manasai tāni kartavyaṃ vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā || 9 ||

iti śrī || ||


