snānādikaṃ tvayaivoktaṃ pūrvaṃ vai mānasaṃ vibho |
tadahaṃ śrotumicchāmi yathārthaṃ tadbravīhi me || 1 ||

śivatīrthaṃ sthitaṃ dehe sarvatīrthālāṃ hitam |
bhurloke tu bhuvo loke svarloke tu tathaiva ca || 2 ||

gaṅgādyāḥ saritaḥ sarvāḥ kṣīrodādyāśca sāgarāḥ |
sarve tiṣṭhanti tatraiva mānase tvakhilā guha || 3 ||

hṛt puṇḍarīka madhyasthaṃ śivatīrthaṃ tu mānasam |
tatrasthaṃ saṅgamaṃ vatsa śivaṃ nādātmakaṃ śubham || 4 ||

agnīṣomīyagahanaṃ pāṇāpānajalāśayam |
pravāhaṃ tasya tīrthasya suṣumṇāḍyāntare sthitam || 5 ||

<p. 44b> turyasthānāmṛtaughena plāvitaśca samantataḥ |
na cātra vighnā hiṃsanti duṣṭā ye vai carācare || 6 ||

tadā snānaṃ śubhaṃ tatra śivatīrthe ca mānase |
nā cātra hiṃsā dṛśyeta na tu pītvā karaṃ tathā || 7 ||

carācaresmin ye lokāḥ puṇyanyāyatanāni ca |
tepi tiṣṭanti cāteva ātmaśuddhyartha kāraṇam || 8 ||

bāhyatīrthāni sarvāṇi kalpanākalpitāni tu |
śivatīrthena tiṣṭhanti mānase aśivāpahe || 9 ||

kalpitā ye bahiṣkāni tīrthānyāyatanāni ca |
uttaptāste sadā vighnairdivyabhaumāntarikṣagaiḥ || 10 ||

tasmāt te dūṣitā vatsa śivatīrthena kena cit |
anorthādbāhyatīrthāni varjitāni sadā guha || 11 ||

<p. 45a> uccāṭane tu vighnānāṃ hiṃsā bhavati vai tadā |
yasmād bādhā bhavet teṣāṃ tasmāt tāstu vivarjayet || 12 ||

nirmalaṃ vighna rahitaṃ mohadaṃ tu aghāpaham |
amṛtaṃ sravate nityaṃ piṅgalābhyantare sthitam || 13 ||

sauṣumṇā nanda gambhīraṃ turyā tu prāntagocaram |
svarṇopalabdhi vimalaṃ sā nandaṃ nandaśītalam || 14 ||

taṃ labdhā śivatīrthaṃ vai ātmano hṛdi saṃsthitam |
tasmin snānaṃ sadā kuryād vidhi dṛṣṭena karmaṇā || 15 ||

sandhyā tu vandayet tatra tarpayet pitṛ devatāḥ |
yat kiñciditi kartavyaṃ tat sarvaṃ mānasaṃ kuru || 16 ||

athavā smaryate tīrthaṃ yat kiñcin manasepsitam |
sarve tiṣṭhanti cātraiva ahiṃsā tu samarpitāḥ || 17 ||

<p. 45b> vayaṃ brahmādibhiḥ sārdhaṃ śivatīrthāmbu sevanāt |
etaddhi paramaṃ tīrthamayaṃ hi paramo japaḥ || 18 ||

etaddhi paramaṃ snānaṃ tatra snānaṃ tu vai guha |
bāhyatīrthāni tuṣṭāni mantrān bāhyāṃstu sarvaśaḥ || 19 ||

mantrā hṛṣṭāni tuṣyanti anyathā jala eva saḥ |
tīrtheṣu ye sthitāḥ keciddīnādyāḥ prāṇino guha || 20 ||

atorthāstena muñcanti vijñāna rahitāstu ye |
śivatīrthaparijñānātsamyagyoga balena tu || 21 ||

snāto bhavati taṃ nityaṃ sādhakaḥ su samāhitaḥ |
na cātra hiṃsate kaścin na tilāndarbha eva ca || 22 ||

na tu rau(?)pya suvarṇe vā khaḍgā pātotha vā punaḥ |
smaraṇā cchivatīrthasya na kiñcidapi lupyate || 23 ||


<p. 46a> śivatīrthaṃ mayā jñātaṃ tasmin sthāne yathoditam |
bhūyo vijñātumicchāmi dhyānaṃ deheśvarātmakam || 1 ||

sarvaṃ pratyakṣa vijñānaṃ mayā te prakaṭī kṛtam |
pratyakṣaṃ ca parokṣaṃ ca adhunā darśayāmite || 2 ||

śivatīrtha parijñānaṃ yairjñātaṃ hyātma darśibhiḥ |
taiḥ prāpyamakhilaṃ vatsa mokṣamārgaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 3 ||

ātmajñāne sthitā ye vai ātmajñāścātma darśinaḥ |
taiḥ śuddhāḥ sarvadā vatsa yatra yatrāśrame sthitāḥ || 4 ||

snāna śuddhirna teṣāṃ vai na mantraiśca prayojanam |
<p. 46b> sa tu mantraṃ śivaṃ śāstraṃ kṣetraṃ hi paramaṃ tu saḥ || 5 ||

na tasya vighnā hiṃsanti ye kecidbhuvana traye |
darśanādeva vai tasya naśyante ca diśo daśa || 6 ||

na diśo vidiśaścaiva na mudrā nāsanāni ca |
karaṇena tu saṃpaśyet samyag yoga balena tu || 7 ||

pūrakaṃ kumbhakaṃ caiva recakaṃ ca tṛtīyakam |
etad yathārthaṃ yuñjīta tato dhyānaṃ samārabhet || 8 ||

dhyānenālokayedvatsa dehi sandeha varjitaḥ |
taṃ vicāraya yatnena nāḍicakrodare sthitam || 9 ||

dvāsaptati sahasrāṇi ārāṇāṃ tasya ṣaṇmukha |
ekaika bhramataiṣā vai prāṇāpānāntara sthitā || 10 ||

sarveṣāmeva vāyūnāṃ prāṇāpānau tu codakau |
<p. 47a> prāṇaṃ teṣāṃ bhavet prāṇaṃ praṇamya tu paraṃ viduḥ || 11 ||

tena te nāḍicakraṃ vai samastamavalokayet |
piṅgalā tu bhavennābhistasya cakrasya ṣaṇmukha || 12 ||

praṇavaṃ taṃ bhaveccakraṃ piṅgalā tasya vai śikhā |
taṃ jñātvā paśyate vatsa śivaṃ parama kāraṇam || 13 ||

jñānadīpaṃ prajajvālya dhyātvā jñānāgninā guha |
tadā gamya sthitaṃ devaṃ piṅgalābhyantare sthitam || 14 ||

hṛdguhā sā tu vijñeyā hṛnmadhye sā tu karṇikā |
tasya madhye sthitaṃ devaṃ yaḥ paśyati sa paśyati || 15 ||

sūryendu vahni madhyasthaṃmalakṣaṃ lakṣa varjitam |
kadambagolakākāraṃ sūryakoṭi samaprabham || 16 ||

kalpāntā nalasaṅkāśaṃ duṣprekṣamakṛtātmabhiḥ |
<p. 47b> anumānaṃ na vai tasya hetunā naiva dṛśyate || 17 ||

evaṃ dhyātvā tu taṃ devaṃ hṛdguhābhyantare sthitam |
tatastvā yatanaṃ gacchenmānusaṃ mānasena tu || 18 ||



dhyānaṃ dheyaṃ mayā jñātaṃ (*)(?) naṃ ca jñeyameva ca |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi hṛdguhyeśvara pūjanam || 1 ||

guhyāni yāni coktāni ādau(?) te śikhi vāhana |
idaṃ guhyaṃ tvayaivādya yanna kasyāpi bhāṣitam || 2 ||

ajñā ye ca anātmajña ye ca paṇḍita māvi (*)(?) |
(*)(?) yajanti sa jīvaistu jīvaiścicchakti sambhavaiḥ || 3 ||

caitanyaṃ(?) sa(?)rvabhūtānāṃ citsvabhāvena saṃsthitam |
<p. 48a> sa cetanāni bhūtāni yasmāt tāneva mohayet || 4 ||

cicchaktiṃ vindate vatsa mukhaduḥkhe śubhāśubhau |
śivātmā dṛṣṭa rūpeṇa sarvatraiva vyavasthitaḥ || 5 ||

aśubhaṃ ca śubhaṃ caiva sukhaṃ duḥkhaṃ tathaiva ca |
bhuñjate tu parāśaktiḥ paraṃ cātra alepakam || 6 ||

sākṣi bhūtaṃ ca taṃ vatsa pakṣayorubhayorapi |
evaṃ jñātvā ahiṃsāṃ vai sarvabhūteṣu kārayet || 7 ||

atorthaṃ mānasaṃ yāgaṃ kartavyaṃ mokṣayāyibhiḥ |
hiṃsā yuktena yogena sambhāra bahulena ca || 8 ||

ye yajanti hite baddhāḥ phalaṃ teṣāṃ triviṣṭapam |
amānāmnā tu yogena hiṃsā bhavati sarvadā || 9 ||

punarāvartate bhūyo bhūyo bhūyaḥ kṣayaṃ gataḥ |
<p. 48b> evaṃ jñātvā yajet sarvaṃ mānusaṃ yāgamuttamam || 10 ||

yasya sarvagataṃ bhāvaṃ yathātmani tathāpare |
samaṃ paśyati sarveṣāmahiṃsā procyate tu sā || 11 ||

yathātmani pare tadvatsamaṃ paśyati yo guha |
samuktaḥ prakṛterbandhācchive tiṣṭhati śāśvate || 12 ||

sāttvikaṃ bhāvametaddhi śivenoktaṃ hi mānasam |
antaḥ karṇādikaṃ vatsa yanmayoktaṃ hi darśane || 13 ||

teṣu bhūtānu hiṃsanti tasmāt taṃ hiṃsa pūrvakam |
antaḥkaraṇa vinyāsaṃ bhūtaśuddhyartha kāraṇam || 14 ||

krīyate sarvato vatsa vidhi dṛṣṭena karmaṇā |
kṛtvāntaḥ karaṇaṃ vatsa bhūtaśuddhiṃ tathaiva ca || 15 ||

tadā bhavati taṃ yogyaṃ sādhakaḥ śiva pūjane |
<p. 49a> ātmajñaṃ tu punarvatsa nityaśuddhaṃ sadā bhavet || 16 ||

nāsya śuddhiraśuddhirvā śodhanīyaṃ hi ketanam |
nitya śuddhi hitaṃ bhūtvā na kiñcit sādhayatyasau || 17 ||

vikalporthairmalairvatsa aśuddhaṃ taṃ ca tattvataḥ |
yasya śaktirbhavatyugrā yaḥ śodhayati vai param || 18 ||

sa śodhayati sarveṣāṃ bhūtānāṃ ca samuddharet |
atorthāt ketanaṃ vatsa ātmajñe niṣprayojanam || 19 ||

sa eva bhogavānsākṣācchivaṃ parama kāraṇam |
sa eva paramaṃ dāma tatra śuddhyati te khilaṃ || 20 ||

ātmanenātmanā caiva yajate parameśvaram |
yathoktena vidhānena samyg yoga balena tu || 21 ||

yajate mānasaṃ yāgaṃ manasā tu amīśvaram |
<p. 49b> yajante devatāssarve brahmādyāśca maharṣayaḥ || 22 ||

tadātvaṃ mānase naiva yāgena śikhivāhana |
yogārthaṃ dravya sambhāraṃ taṃ hi cātraiva tiṣṭhati || 23 ||

atha prārthayase kāmaṃ manasā manasepsitam |
taṃ labhiṣyasi sarvaṃ vai mānase taṃ śikhidhvaja || 24 ||

sākāraṃ yajate yastu nirākārotha vā punaḥ |
ubhau tāvekadā vatsa yajatvaṃ yat tu rocate || 25 ||

nirlakṣaṃ nissvabhāvastaṃ sa lakṣaṃ pratimākṛtim |
manasā citsvabhāvena sākārā kriyate kriyā || 26 ||

na caivā kṛtimānkaściccitsvabhāvonilaṃ bhavet |
tasmāt tvaṃ sarvadā vatsa nityaṃ śakti sthitaṃ yajet || 27 ||

citsaṃjñā citsamudbhutā bhutābhuteṣu saṃsthitā || 28 ||

tattvāśca bhutā bhāvāni cicchaktyā bhyantare sthitāḥ |
saṃsthitāścivatattve rasadasarvagato vibhuḥ || 29 ||

sarvamevaṃ hitaṃ vatsa hṛdisthaṃ prakaṭī kṛtam |
taṃ hi pūjaya yatvena vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā || 30 ||

na kaścidapitaṃ vatsa yasya taṃ na hṛdi sthitam |
tasmāttaṃ pūjayedvatsa ahiṃsā kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 31 ||

hṛdisthaṃ tu punarvatsa sarvakāmaistu pūjayet |
dānāni yāni coktāni śivadharmekhilāni tu || 32 ||

tāni dattāni sarvāṇi bhavanti śikhivāhana |
sarvakāmāni vai tadvatmānasaṃ yāga muttamam || 33 ||

<p. 50b> yāgaṃ tu paramaṃ hyetat sarvayāgottamottamam |
iḍādayo yajed yastu rājasaṃ yāgamucyate || 34 ||

suṣumṇā tāmasaṃ(?) bhogaṃ(?) jñeyaṃ sātvikaṃ piṅgalodaye |
suṣumṇe tvāṃ parityajya piṅgalā nāḍisthaṃ yajet || 35 ||

tāṃ vicāra yatnena brahmanāḍiśca ucyate |
tasmin madhye sthitaṃ devaṃ taṃ nedaṃ pūjayet tu saḥ || 36 ||

yatkiñciditi kartavyaṃ tatsarvaṃ piṅgalodaye |
turyodbhavati(?) sarvāṇi turyasthāne gatāni tu || 37 ||

cintayet sarvakāmāni anyathā hiṃsitāni tu |
turyasthāne layaṃ kṛtvā hṛdhisthaṃ pūjayet sadā || 38 ||

yasya turye gatirnāsti hṛdisthaṃ tu kathaṃ yajet |
hṛdisthaṃ turyasaṃsthaṃ tu ubhau yo vetti tatvataḥ || 39 ||

<p. 51a> ekataṃ bhūya eteṣāṃ sa pūjāṃ kartu marhati |
prāṇāpānāntarasthena śivena śikhivāhana || 40 ||

yojayet sādhako vatsa sa vai sādhaka ucyate |
prāṇāpānau tu sandigdhau rajastamasamanvitau || 41 ||

tasmāt tau varjayet vatsa yāgakāle tu sarvadā |
sātvikaṃ saṅgamaṃ teṣāṃ tena kuryācchivārcanam || 42 ||

vahni pūjā tu te naiva anyathā na kṛtā bhavet |
brahmādi stambha paryantaṃ trailokyaṃ sa carācaram || 43 ||

ahiṃsā puṣpasekena pūjitaṃ taṃ sadā bhavet |
<p. 51b> mānase naiva yāgena muktohaṃ sarvadā vibho || 44 ||



tathāpi jñātu micchāmi japyaṃ vai sarvadā param || 1 ||

mānasaiścākṣaraughaiśca prāṇāpānau śikhidhvaja |
rahasyaṃ caiva guhyaṃ ca japyaṃ japyottamottamam || 2 ||

japyaṃ bahuvidhaṃ proktaṃ śivena paramātmanā |
na punarmānasaṃ japyaṃ mokṣamārgaphalapradam || 3 ||

mayi tuṣṭena nāthena ayaṃ mārgaḥ pradarśitaḥ |
tadāhaṃ kathayiṣyāmi rahasyaṃ kṛttikā suta || 4 ||

sarveṣāmeva bhūtānāṃ hṛdisthaṃ yatparaṃ padam |
sa tu saṅkhyā yate japyaṃ japaṃ tu kurute tu saḥ || 5 ||

ajñānā naiva budhyante jñānavijñāna varjitāḥ |
<p. 52a> pratyahaṃ pratyahaṃ vatsa japasaṅkhyaṃ karoti saḥ || 6 ||

abyucchinna prabandhena maṇibhiḥ paramaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
sūrya cicchaktirityāhustasmiṃste kathitā guha || 7 ||

akṣasūtra paraṃ hyetadyogināṃ tattva cintakaḥ |
ye sthitā phalasandhāne vaśyākarṣaṇamāraṇe || 8 ||

japaṃ teṣāṃ tu mantraiśca akṣasūtrairanekaśaḥ |
punarātma vide vatsa mantra tantraiḥ prayojanam || 9 ||

prayojanaṃ bhavet teṣāmātmajñānena kevalam |
taṃ viditvā mahāsena mantratantrāṃstyajedguha || 10 ||

athavā saṅkhyayā kāryaṃ mānasesmiñjape guha |
tatohaṃ kathayiṣyāmi yathā bhavati tacchṛṇu || 11 ||

