<p. 52b> ahorātrāntare japyaṃ kurute satataṃ śivaḥ |
śivajapyaṃ bhavedeṣa śivaṃ hyaśiva kāriṇam || 14 ||

prāṇaśca karṣate pānamapānaḥ prāṇameva ca |
ubhau cākarṣayedyastu sa japaṃ kurute guha || 15 ||

hṛtsthānād dvādaśāntaṃ tu dvādaśāntāt punarhṛdi |
evāṃ gamāgamaṃ jñeyaṃ taṃ japaṃ brahmaśāśvatam || 16 ||



viditaṃ mānasaṃ japyamakṣasūtraṃ tathaiva ca |
agnikāryaṃ ca metātatatvamācakṣva vai prabho || 1 ||

mayājñānāmṛtaṃ vatsa snehāt te prakaṭī kṛtam |
bhūyopi kathayiṣyāmi agnikāryaṃ tu mānasam || 2 ||

<p. 53a> carācarāṇāṃ bhūtānāṃ sarveṣāṃ śikhivāhana |
hṛdisthaṃ paramaṃ tejo na tu jānanti mohitāḥ || 3 ||

ādityastapate tasya tejasā tasya vai guha |
jvalanasya tu tat tejaḥ pūrṇamindustathaiva ca || 4 ||

tarhyupāsītavidhivadagnī yaḥ śikhivāhana |
bāhyegnīnāṃ hutaṃ havyaṃ hiṃsanti guhyakādayaḥ || 5 ||

mantra doṣāśca doṣāśca aśubhairvādayā bhavet |
tadā te lupyate vatsa bāhyāgniṣu hutaṃ haviḥ || 6 ||

idhmādi dravyasaṃbhāraṃ sarvaṃ cicchakti saṃbhavam |
yadātra hūyate yasmāt tasmāt taṃ hiṃsapūrvakam || 7 ||

ahiṃsā pūrvakaṃ vatsa svadehe hyagni pūjanam |
śivāgnirvaibhavatyeṣa śivamaśivahāriṇam || 8 ||



(???????????????????)

<p. 53b> garbhādānādi saṃskārairna hi tatra prayojanam |
na hi kuṇḍaṃ nu vaḥ kāryaṃ mekhalairvātha yoninā || 9 ||

kāryamevaṃ hi vai cātra vidhināśikhi vāhana |
kuṇḍatrayaṃ sthitaṃ dehe agni tritayameva ca || 10 ||

gārhapatyāgni hṛtkuṇḍe nābhikuṇḍegni dakṣiṇam |
mukhakuṇḍe sthitaṃ vatsa nāmnācāhavaniyakam || 11 ||

kuṇḍāgni tritayaṃ vatsa mayā te darśitaṃ kramāt |
teṣāṃ homaṃ prakurvīta vidhi dṛṣṭena karmaṇā || 12 ||

suṣumṇā nāḍimāśritya kuryādvai cottarāyaṇam |
dakṣiṇāgniṃ tato juhyānnābhikuṇḍe sthite guha || 13 ||

iḍā nāḍyudayaṃ kṛtvā kuryādvai dakṣiṇāyanam |
tadācāhavanīyognirmukhakuṇḍe sthito guha || 14 ||

<p. 54a> gārhapatyastu yo hyagnirhṛtkuṇḍe saṃsthitassadā |
tasmin pūrṇāhutiṃ dadyādviṣuvatkaraṇena tu || 15 ||

viṣuvaṃ tu bhavedvatsa piṅganāḍyudayena tu |
tasmin kāle yajed yastu tatsarvaṃ cākṣayaṃ bhavet || 16 ||

siddhyante sarvakāmāni manasā cepsitāni ca |
prāṇādyā vāyavaḥ pañca homayet tu yathā kramam || 17 ||

tairhutaiḥ sarvamakhilaṃ viśvaṃ santarpitaṃ bhavet |
amṛtaṃ bhavate vatsa amṛtaṃ taṃtu tiṣṭhati || 18 ||

tadā tadakhilaṃ viśvaṃ tṛptaṃ bhavati cāpare |
prāṇāpānāntarasthaṃ tu yairjñātaṃ śikhivāhana || 19 ||

tepi vantyamṛtaṃ divyaṃ turyasthānodbhavaṃ param |
turyodbhavāmṛtājyena nityamagniṃ prapūjayet || 20 ||

agni pūjā bhavatyeṣā akṣayyā muktidā śubhā ||

[iti śrībrahmasandhānāgni (*) jā (*) cā (*) ni (*) yo (*) mā] ||

adya me saphalā buddhiḥ śrutvā brahmapadaṃ param || ||


